                  "displayName" : "Lewis Pringle",
                  "self" : "https://stroika.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A4fe560ca-b4e1-41d1-9bdf-97b1684eda32",
                  "timeZone" : "America/New_York"
               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "I added a feature to Stroika's configuration service to configure stack checkers if avialable.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "I opened new bug reports (linked here - 474/475) to track feature improvements we could do in teh future to help address this.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "But none are easy, nor I think very important. For any decent system, we get checks that detect this issue, and for indecent systems (AIX) - I'm not sure we can do better than we have (at least not much withotu a ton of effort). So closed...",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
                  "type" : "doc",
                  "version" : 1
               },
